    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-feb472d9-716f-4352-9ae3-7a3aa7ac4255" n="0877" facs="#m-67a64286-447c-4b78-8768-f1c32acf6bf5" /><div xml:id="m-db6af2b4-40fa-47ce-9295-0aa5332875f5">
            <lg xml:id="m-50cab88e-aa79-41a6-8e9f-67f7458d95ff">
              <l xml:id="m-c6acce6f-7291-42f6-adca-64c54d959c1e" facs="#m-2a79b13f-fabc-4745-b818-d89ef611a822" label="text-like">The Solemn afternoon Liturgy</l><l xml:id="m-aece148e-2097-4d52-a84d-857da3708b13" facs="#m-1cd74eb9-5c91-488f-a7cc-20ab508d173d" label="ambiguous">721</l><l xml:id="m-282eecfe-1baf-45ab-8b76-df1340965b7c" facs="#m-eea29128-838e-4c2c-9f02-6d4102e3919d" label="lyrics-like">audisset Pilátus hunc sermónem,</l><l xml:id="m-6a86e9b7-f85a-4357-924a-e1e75bf7f5f4" facs="#m-6554ed05-605c-4b53-b4c6-bc2911a2b290" label="lyrics-like">Et erat scriptum hebráice, graece,</l><l xml:id="m-321d0d18-9f89-478a-a789-692dbc9417ea" facs="#m-c8937e11-8818-467d-8784-8f9cd6629bb4" label="ambiguous">magis timuit.</l><l xml:id="m-ddcb6dc3-b8e6-4307-87ef-95b46f6abcd4" facs="#m-094fce78-ad05-4087-975f-99e1039fda4c" label="lyrics-like">et latine. Dicébant ergo Piláto</l><l xml:id="m-74a708d4-9d5e-44d4-abe6-08a1c9cebf00" facs="#m-f319cf28-399d-42e1-973e-e4dca8e78aa4" label="lyrics-like">pontifices Judacórum: S. Noli</l><l xml:id="m-2b45bce9-82fa-4421-aa9a-31e7654bb5ab" facs="#m-751050d2-a6b8-4aa7-ae46-8f5702f5d40c" label="lyrics-like">Et ingréssus est praetórium</l><l xml:id="m-7d315b16-f434-4976-9aaa-c8bf57b9ce9e" facs="#m-da8e63a8-5eb9-4c7d-a728-5fccb630389f" label="ambiguous">sterum: et dixit ad Jesum</l><l xml:id="m-5e726c19-a620-4237-8fd5-3f0ee48474d1" facs="#m-0dcaacdb-7087-427a-934b-53b5a25885d4" label="lyrics-like">scribere, Rex Judacórum, sed</l><l xml:id="m-14136682-e698-47cb-b023-fed2de6ff057" facs="#m-74eae09b-d1c9-4224-aa91-08e897448a4a" label="ambiguous">S. Unde es tu? C. Iesus autem</l><l xml:id="m-8661269b-9b56-42fd-8b7f-44f1e94b5e9a" facs="#m-0fa3f08c-eee1-485e-a675-294f0099539d" label="lyrics-like">quia ipse dixit : Rex sum Judaeó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b644a991-ea6e-4e8d-a4ab-a405d8ef05eb" facs="#m-7f479e7d-a41b-4b01-978b-10438acf8c2c" label="lyrics-like">rum. C. Respóndit Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-3cea1fb4-8c5b-45b0-8165-b18bdf103380" facs="#m-4eb5dc82-2852-4c1e-a8ad-b06c7f18a427" label="lyrics-like">respónsum non dedit ei. Dicit</l><l xml:id="m-5ce352a6-d660-47e8-9d3d-9ee3e4c5bc64" facs="#m-a71859bc-c633-4310-9be2-0c6c993f4ded" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-baa66c9d-61b9-4ab4-b939-33bc50ef3087" facs="#m-7b9a6e7b-982b-47c6-8b55-295654cef312" label="lyrics-like">ergo ei Pilátus: S. Mihi non</l><l xml:id="m-2cb4ccab-6c59-40e4-a4fd-4b1aa67d94a6" facs="#m-9853f932-7739-47e4-ba67-69e2d4ab277d" label="ambiguous">S. Quod scripsi, scripsi.</l><l xml:id="m-005ca329-3f3b-4175-946b-702f7f66b896" facs="#m-d8e6414c-b6b8-44ce-a430-2ec0b0d39a4d" label="lyrics-like">C. Mslites ergo cum crucifixís¬</l><l xml:id="m-42bd8c48-653c-4218-ae7f-c73f82e5d929" facs="#m-f7ff90f8-a6f1-437f-bcc4-5ea69a749956" label="lyrics-like">lóqueris? nescis quia potestátem</l><l xml:id="m-68adf808-a496-47ed-916e-9d165ba3986b" facs="#m-712ad4ea-fe73-4a04-9559-5909fa6e8d6d" label="lyrics-like">hábeo crucifigere te, et potestá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2af04d33-5056-4a82-ba67-3a6ae3198ec9" facs="#m-a03e6f7b-5235-4e2c-bad4-b77f4f9f1de9" label="lyrics-like">sent eum, accepérunt vestiménta</l><l xml:id="m-735845b0-e3ca-4f37-ac74-02158bf7cb20" facs="#m-d7787541-664b-49db-9662-28cee5e57b82" label="lyrics-like">tem hábeo dimittere te? C. Re¬</l><l xml:id="m-c79dabb5-7c7f-43e5-9d6f-30aa584b1c47" facs="#m-2b357d19-2280-4143-a6b6-6def12b4a467" label="lyrics-like">ejus et fecérunt quátuor partes:</l><l xml:id="m-cc339b33-b977-4c8c-8918-f8c10edb653d" facs="#m-bd25e5c8-94ab-4627-8292-29964ba1efb5" label="lyrics-like">spóndit Jesus: 4Non habéres</l><l xml:id="m-c61213b4-c203-48bb-be57-4c766c0b13ad" facs="#m-2140e5d8-899c-47b0-9ec1-7808c2ca0cb8" label="lyrics-like">unicuique militi partem, et túni¬</l><l xml:id="m-df2559f3-6726-4c53-a5cd-ff6935339abc" facs="#m-26e716ef-9702-45bd-a9da-747bc5ccbebc" label="lyrics-like">potestátem advérsum me ullam,</l><l xml:id="m-0a3fe006-e68b-4bbd-ab5c-f85b49e62adf" facs="#m-5da66fc4-3b34-4ffe-8177-3f795c5f2d6d" label="lyrics-like">cam. Erat autem túnica inconsú¬</l><l xml:id="m-372fa85f-af5c-41ca-b684-0450e7ea5f4c" facs="#m-5e445ca0-f8b4-43f1-8906-0899f9c56ab1" label="lyrics-like">nisi tibi datum esset désuper.</l><l xml:id="m-b80d1e7f-4971-4347-b4cb-60a925737327" facs="#m-bb2b0cda-85c6-436a-8905-68380eee0b95" label="lyrics-like">tilis, désuper contéxta per totum.</l><l xml:id="m-d5ae13d1-befb-48c6-81b0-796eabeecf49" facs="#m-a760e4d7-3b17-447d-8b09-c9a57ad3d3d8" label="lyrics-like">Proptérea, qui me trádidit tibi,</l><l xml:id="m-2291a478-9819-4840-b953-6eb65bb98f8c" facs="#m-1c716549-6a1f-4b33-828d-382be02701ec" label="lyrics-like">Dixérunt ergo ad invicem: S. Non</l><l xml:id="m-9b263872-c6ad-477b-9041-f08757b083ea" facs="#m-7cbeef07-d04b-40b8-a03c-2d7a6d79a929" label="lyrics-like">majus peccãtum habet. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-b6ee50f3-d0b7-4981-9208-c9909aaa86a5" facs="#m-fc74f029-4d10-454e-b55b-f225242a496f" label="lyrics-like">scindámus eam, sed sortiámur de</l><l xml:id="m-d2816123-b9aa-4d8d-a924-285e3f1aa623" facs="#m-d31012ba-eb6b-4bd1-8c3a-6c610b5d4a99" label="lyrics-like">exinde quaerébat Pilátus dimit¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f69dbd9-5b34-40fc-aee4-fcc2b7491b00" facs="#m-0c9a1304-15f1-4d79-bdce-0b5d99efc032" label="lyrics-like">illa cujus sit. C. Ut scriptúra</l><l xml:id="m-b73dec03-7430-45ef-bbcf-f2d613d7eb6f" facs="#m-292d4926-8668-4aa8-9dcc-f0e6ef9a3cbb" label="lyrics-like">implerétur, dicens: Partiti sunt</l><l xml:id="m-497d2341-0eb8-4334-b843-59eb68ac37ee" facs="#m-dce6479a-cfa2-49d1-b110-4e8bdff2b822" label="lyrics-like">tere eum. Judaéi autem clamá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9572d7f8-f076-46bf-a9f0-a65d2a236678" facs="#m-6b9d69ad-b22e-49a5-a4c4-8f9b94cbab2a" label="lyrics-like">bant, dicéntes : S. Si hunc di¬</l><l xml:id="m-b63965b6-fbab-4ad1-bb26-5076ecd0bf34" facs="#m-8e32c510-5fc2-455f-a4d7-8e4fa91bde6c" label="lyrics-like">vestiménta mea sibi: et investem</l><l xml:id="m-0f780036-9760-4047-896e-6d414e026899" facs="#m-7fe63891-3a1a-40e2-8676-1973a9dbbedf" label="lyrics-like">mittis, non es amicus Caésaris.</l><l xml:id="m-2b528025-992f-4e26-b1ec-e0b0321e60ad" facs="#m-f8ffef37-f4ab-44e0-a34b-75a95b2f6a01" label="lyrics-like">meam misérunt sortem. Et míli¬</l><l xml:id="m-4777c859-bbbf-4f00-9414-79442ab8b204" facs="#m-7ba68bfb-0be7-4fbe-a8cb-908a2010bd8a" label="ambiguous">Omnis enim, qui se regem facit,</l><l xml:id="m-55f411d7-faef-4b82-a98a-ea373a6af960" facs="#m-97cc6c9f-afc9-4d0f-b93b-7783cb150128" label="lyrics-like">tes quidem haec fecérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-222ddc07-9fd6-435e-9b09-c2914d8ab20d" facs="#m-c367688a-9e21-411f-b09f-96f7bbdaff04" label="lyrics-like">contradicit Caésari. C. Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-881120e6-b312-4497-92e3-0765d557e894" facs="#m-a60a1f4f-8d01-430c-a202-45ca3d423cba" label="ambiguous">Stabant autem juxta crucem</l><l xml:id="m-a412794b-b04b-417d-8da5-15469244f5f9" facs="#m-3fcca8f3-520d-47f5-a7bf-dd39c8877e27" label="ambiguous">Jesu mater ejus, et soror matris</l><l xml:id="m-1c0234bb-ee25-4dc2-80aa-a1f9315838b3" facs="#m-d778d02e-1f0e-48dd-b79e-caa3a10c1edb" label="lyrics-like">autem cum audísset hos sermó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d73bdcc5-19d6-49b4-874b-5da8929c90fb" facs="#m-2ff42629-e1f0-4e55-a649-e58914a7e834" label="lyrics-like">ejus Maria Cléophae, et Maria</l><l xml:id="m-a8c84b78-86bd-4c62-9644-157d3bb138e8" facs="#m-a2b2b229-56ce-43a0-8f7d-8ba36a027549" label="lyrics-like">nes, addúxit foras Jesum, et</l><l xml:id="m-6d8d2651-f39d-40bc-8d00-0be6aebb4965" facs="#m-a9b19770-6ac3-49ab-a6d7-b12e77255a13" label="lyrics-like">Magdaléne. Cum vidísset ergo</l><l xml:id="m-5967725e-3306-4f6b-b067-c612c1ecbd6d" facs="#m-8e9af707-9da1-4197-85fe-a56e726a5926" label="lyrics-like">sedit pro tribunáli, in loco, qui</l><l xml:id="m-8eeb6496-13d2-4d6b-a26e-2939faed3543" facs="#m-0a7956a5-d7c2-4cdf-8fae-d4239365f856" label="lyrics-like">dicitur Lithóstrotos, hebráice</l><l xml:id="m-28192e8a-8766-4680-81e6-210a110f3519" facs="#m-95c5321f-6b9b-4756-9b5c-b1cedcae2eec" label="lyrics-like">Jesus matrem, et discípulum</l><l xml:id="m-93f34163-860d-4942-8677-dcbb25816332" facs="#m-be269f18-51a4-4b84-870c-1c79367405a2" label="lyrics-like">stantem, quem diligébat, dicit</l><l xml:id="m-c8fcdcae-7152-43bf-917c-c56526ba0d9e" facs="#m-3149a53a-d8e9-431f-8c40-123c8e197f9d" label="lyrics-like">autem Gábbatha. Érat autem</l><l xml:id="m-8b9df504-a7b9-42d7-aa30-d5229df52d8c" facs="#m-c48e5b82-d5be-4338-ba44-8eb63253667a" label="lyrics-like">matri suae : 4 Mulier, eccé rilius</l><l xml:id="m-c67ec718-092a-4007-a0b5-46afa9ca2e55" facs="#m-9818e2cc-e34d-4904-b043-7c7fbdcaa778" label="lyrics-like">Parascéve Paschae, hora quasi</l><l xml:id="m-55d6125a-512b-4251-9f84-691eff0c7bd1" facs="#m-015466fe-08e4-4c3a-8080-dacebc681116" label="lyrics-like">tuus. C. Deínde dicit discipulo:</l><l xml:id="m-f3812d45-ba68-48f9-a884-7296d946c112" facs="#m-910b8967-e886-479c-87b3-e9fc151974a5" label="lyrics-like">sexta, et dicit Judaéis: S. Ecce</l><l xml:id="m-204bdb7a-8a65-43dc-a522-604f6347c6b5" facs="#m-a1260989-d9f9-4ca7-b5ba-f7862a921f49" label="ambiguous">4 Ecce mater tua. C. Et ex illa</l><l xml:id="m-3ea1f63f-2f40-4312-aa91-d7d7dfe253c7" facs="#m-c3dad6ae-43e0-4442-b85b-be3722636ec0" label="ambiguous">Rex vester. C. Illi autem cla¬</l><l xml:id="m-07d41dea-447c-4c7c-a0fc-b281d36e3913" facs="#m-8d51c29c-2e82-444c-a2d2-f09f391b3060" label="lyrics-like">hora accépit eam discipulus in</l><l xml:id="m-5f203a9f-4353-4279-bfe9-88fb61127cd4" facs="#m-dc10fd90-41b2-47f5-9c49-727160fc7081" label="lyrics-like">mábant: S. Tolle, tolle, cruci¬</l><l xml:id="m-30e40800-5339-41fd-95cb-ff6dd0317801" facs="#m-d8f023d4-0568-4c42-8c48-84f590e8da37" label="lyrics-like">fige eum. C. Dicit eis Pilátus:</l><l xml:id="m-a602ebd5-6968-4116-828d-ceac4b4f5da1" facs="#m-07c00ba0-1091-4826-bfd4-029eb0b45de0" label="ambiguous">sua.</l><l xml:id="m-e602785c-530b-47c8-83ff-0708d47b6ae9" facs="#m-5063a94f-6ace-4c49-85db-054220d7adbf" label="lyrics-like">Póstea sciens Jesus quia ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-35b0983d-0c68-4080-9c7c-a6c756b85060" facs="#m-db40465d-6b4d-496e-971e-09e5af8a7242" label="ambiguous">s. Regem vestrum crucifigam?</l><l xml:id="m-9a3a5712-a8c4-4860-8a62-6cac51a237d5" facs="#m-0fa4442e-93d9-4c4c-be76-a46074ad3aed" label="lyrics-like">consummáta sunt, ut consumma¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0a343f3-f496-4d6d-ba88-fedb37b3e855" facs="#m-4f6395d5-b7a6-443d-8d6c-36762b6e95a0" label="lyrics-like">C. Respondérunt pontinices</l><l xml:id="m-14b417eb-607c-483e-8d23-43ee9ba9fff2" facs="#m-41cace1d-80e1-44f8-9079-b8cbb23ec48c" label="lyrics-like">rétur Scriptúra, dixit : 4 Sitio.</l><l xml:id="m-141ba239-1a08-490b-a4dc-3170b224dc7d" facs="#m-2c3b7bf5-d4c9-42c8-9a5e-38d73ee7bd76" label="lyrics-like">s. Non habémus regem, nisi Caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7630ecff-2210-4776-b8d9-31e0bb46bb3f" facs="#m-96e595a6-b6d3-421b-a492-0bc15a0cc287" label="lyrics-like">C. Vas ergo erat pósitum acéto</l><l xml:id="m-55ef4132-8a08-4e3c-8d03-05f70c9f3040" facs="#m-41b955fc-7434-4bdf-9677-9584e50a69e6" label="lyrics-like">sarem. C. Tunc ergo trádidit eis</l><l xml:id="m-01d9ff61-6f6b-482b-ae89-68ac6e28c778" facs="#m-2a8d673f-cc92-4bb3-8a6e-cc25127776ea" label="lyrics-like">illum ut crucifgerétur. Suscepé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9939ae3-dbe0-41bd-b288-1d5479f98a53" facs="#m-a7cca720-b787-44b2-9609-ca84be8fe540" label="lyrics-like">plenum. Illi autem spóngiam ple¬</l><l xml:id="m-b10cb2c3-5561-4482-9747-aeadbda47b57" facs="#m-4413772f-304c-4fc3-a67e-5850f4f53bad" label="lyrics-like">nam acéto, hyssópo circumpo¬</l><l xml:id="m-f4feee57-7788-41fc-a097-57b88d5eff22" facs="#m-6fdfa687-4f22-4c83-8d23-f5df3d87ddf4" label="lyrics-like">runt autem Jesum, et eduxérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-bcfccfd5-211d-45cb-a5bd-4f44c2580776" facs="#m-9eb1784d-9e63-44fd-ab8c-594c8c1d33c5" label="lyrics-like">néntes, obtulérunt ori ejus. Cum</l><l xml:id="m-9e113d13-8f84-4424-b63a-73b8e14e054e" facs="#m-e5975c42-27af-41a5-ac87-2897e9cebbe4" label="lyrics-like">Et bájulans sibi crucem, exsvit</l><l xml:id="m-20d53932-75e2-4e4f-a442-adc477550656" facs="#m-3ca52347-bfdc-4bb4-aeb9-f573a81e39f6" label="lyrics-like">ergo accepisset Jesus acétum, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-08d332dd-0729-491a-84ec-b3f0ac7d0cfe" facs="#m-e7b863e4-bc7b-4280-bff9-6bb635a1f8b7" label="lyrics-like">in eum, qui dicitur Caiváriae,</l><l xml:id="m-cae20ff4-d05d-4342-b5c8-e86d918677a8" facs="#m-e324b10c-3812-44fd-9939-56339a07382e" label="lyrics-like">xit : 4 Consummátum est. C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-492c28a9-870b-4103-8fef-535c50f2e759" facs="#m-57883953-23d3-4202-82e7-e31b9540ff7c" label="lyrics-like">locum, hebráice autem Gólgo¬</l><l xml:id="m-be9a48a2-bc3c-42ad-b8ff-c6b0840b5a3d" facs="#m-9f1ae16f-b6c4-4570-9f5f-9c240986f550" label="lyrics-like">inclinátocápite, trádidit spiritum.</l><l xml:id="m-68dce0b7-7d7e-43bc-9e76-9b346cee6eae" facs="#m-50dedc5f-0886-4253-ab86-f2b64d8fe318" label="lyrics-like">tha: ubi crucifixérunt eum, et</l><l xml:id="m-80a75b32-4f6a-4c1c-be15-b139a9229f1c" facs="#m-1bd26386-e0c3-4f92-8d44-87673f7f3a84" label="text-like">(Here a pause is made, and all</l><l xml:id="m-3fc53101-d4f9-4132-80d8-c06644dfef41" facs="#m-ac5d9874-6261-4d23-987a-44c43aa84785" label="lyrics-like">cum eo álios duos, hinc et hinc,</l><l xml:id="m-d3e76a7d-21b6-4b50-9208-b8f98ed72d42" facs="#m-c5b51fe0-47c2-455f-b23f-57becaa40037" label="lyrics-like">médium autem Jesum.</l><l xml:id="m-1405d618-8901-42b9-9293-ee986122690f" facs="#m-1f51d30f-6b13-4467-bb6a-b39afa1e341b" label="ambiguous">kneel).</l><l xml:id="m-b9721227-977c-4c77-8ea5-a7e38640616d" facs="#m-b6ebb563-4cf4-4f34-a69b-6755f0aea4d0" label="lyrics-like">C. Judaéi ergo, quóniam Para¬</l><l xml:id="m-45c7da35-2f65-45e8-8510-f19122374246" facs="#m-fd462c27-6691-4d48-8d62-953586d74cb1" label="lyrics-like">Scripsit autem et titulum Pilá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7f4e0a5-0032-4fba-aba7-0a1c3e26206e" facs="#m-88de10ef-5a06-4c8f-aea0-9f326de6b1dd" label="lyrics-like">tus: et pósuit super crucem. Erat</l><l xml:id="m-0088f26f-d4f3-40fb-95a0-c802607e03bd" facs="#m-3ea2cad6-430b-4078-807c-d145d9a45e6d" label="lyrics-like">scéve erat, ut non remanérent</l><l xml:id="m-322c9811-5a8b-4c57-9fa6-a9b5574f10e2" facs="#m-7bd3adff-c0ac-455d-80a5-21d6c79a9361" label="lyrics-like">in cruce córpora sábbato, erat</l><l xml:id="m-e3ebfbc2-9816-4c61-950b-7907e1f99ec2" facs="#m-9e712462-667e-4fda-83be-321ab2727d22" label="lyrics-like">autem scriptum: Jesus Nazaré¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d8c6fad-dfc2-4aea-88cd-da347044dccd" facs="#m-c5250de5-aec5-43a3-af75-6ac11feb504b" label="lyrics-like">enim magnus dies ille sábbati,</l><l xml:id="m-3c3d79f0-b878-4ca4-8521-c6a28e886291" facs="#m-4e529f08-59a2-4ccb-86f8-e630530c569b" label="lyrics-like">nus, Rex Judaeórum. Hunc ergo</l><l xml:id="m-dd18cd77-958d-4177-9386-ff846f212037" facs="#m-0a6c418d-17cc-48cb-bef6-9c821499195e" label="lyrics-like">titulum multi Judacórum legé¬</l><l xml:id="m-21cafb19-135f-4182-8c30-2b5a1b12003c" facs="#m-35a0e1a0-d155-4c31-98e0-24d48ee0e1ba" label="lyrics-like">rogavérunt Pilátum, ut frange¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d554364-25a0-4601-9853-a214afd316f2" facs="#m-44bd6689-70a7-49ad-9f30-670e4d50fd0f" label="lyrics-like">réntureórumcrura, et tolleréntur.</l><l xml:id="m-eff6d662-a41d-4dea-875a-2e706663195c" facs="#m-db125ef4-7af3-417e-a6a6-0b2c327fd599" label="lyrics-like">runt, quia prope civitátem erat</l><l xml:id="m-46f659e9-42df-4813-88c5-a35cb54b69f6" facs="#m-b50c4af9-ff9d-4af8-92bb-048fa88de91c" label="lyrics-like">Venérunt ergo milites: et primi</l><l xml:id="m-45933e6d-4904-44a2-bad2-1ee8f78a716d" facs="#m-2e878685-daa6-41b4-b682-13a1692f6d05" label="ambiguous">locus, ubi crucifixus est Jesus.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>